pan></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">식사 수용 가능 인원이 한정되어 있어 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">선착순으로 진행</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하며 수용 가능 인원을 넘을 경우 접수가 불가함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;신청 인원이 수용가능 인원(각 관 100명)을 초과할 경우, 접수 마감 별도&nbsp;공지 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>5. </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>신청방법</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">첨부된 [교차식사 신청서] 작성 후 행정실 방문 또는 이메일 제출 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">방문 제출 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-f